    "user_request_original": "Design and optimize a 26-layer planar dielectric multilayer stack on fused silica substrate using alternating HfO2 and SiO2 layers under normal incidence plane-wave illumination. Initialize all 26 layer thicknesses independently using uniform random distribution bounded between 30 nm and 250 nm. Apply gradient-based thickness optimization to maximize mean reflectance in 300-450 nm band while maximizing mean transmittance in 1000-1700 nm band. Evaluate robustness under ±10% uniform thickness variation. Report best_target_score, tightest_margin, valid_candidates count, and optimized thicknesses_nm array for all candidates. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 300-450 nm, 1000-1700 nm. soft objectives: high transmission in 1000-1700 nm; high reflection in 300-450 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: reflection in 1000-1700 nm; transmission in 300-450 nm. manufacturing constraints: Maximum total layer count of 30.",
